flowchart TD
  start[review start<br/>question, criteria,<br/>optional reviewers and instruments] --> protocol[protocol.json<br/>write-once]
  protocol --> add[add records<br/>DOI, PMID, arXiv,<br/>normalized title and year]
  add --> screen1[Title / abstract screen<br/>per reviewer]
  screen1 -->|include| screen2[Full-text screen<br/>per reviewer]
  screen1 -->|exclude or maybe<br/>with reason| excluded[Excluded or pending]
  screen2 -->|include| evidence[Evidence<br/>claim + verbatim quote + location]
  screen2 -->|exclude with reason| excluded
  screen1 -->|disagreement| reconcile[reconcile<br/>consensus or third reviewer]
  screen2 -->|disagreement| reconcile
  evidence --> appraise[appraise<br/>RoB 2, ROBINS-I,<br/>QUADAS-2, Newcastle-Ottawa]
  appraise -->|disagreement| reconcile
  appraise --> appraisalStatus[appraisal_status<br/>completeness and conflicts]
  reconcile --> appraisalStatus
  evidence --> status[review status<br/>PRISMA-style counts<br/>exclusion reasons and conflicts]
  appraisalStatus --> status
  status --> export[export<br/>markdown, csv, json,<br/>rob-table, rob-summary]
  status --> figure[rob-figure<br/>traffic light + summary SVGs]

  add -. every event appended .-> log[(.dsh/review/slug/<br/>screening.jsonl, evidence.jsonl,<br/>appraisal.jsonl, instruments.json)]
  screen1 -.-> log
  screen2 -.-> log
  evidence -.-> log
  appraise -.-> log
  reconcile -.-> log

  classDef step fill:#ecfdf5,stroke:#059669,color:#064e3b
  classDef store fill:#fff7ed,stroke:#f97316,color:#7c2d12
  class start,add,screen1,screen2,evidence,appraise,appraisalStatus,status,export,figure,reconcile step
  class protocol,log,excluded store
